    id: 'd44_sc04',
    title: 'Resolving Dormitory Housing Allotment and Roommate Compatibility with Residence Dean',
    context: 'First-year postgraduate student Deepak discusses hostel room amenities and study-hour quiet policies with Residence Dean Mrs. Kapoor.',
